SUMMARY:Terrific Tuesdays: Week 1
DESCRIPTION:Splash into Terrific Tuesdays in Rader Park\, a four-week summer program for children ages 3-10 full of stories\, crafts\, and hands-on fun as we learn all about water. \nProgram Schedule (10:00–11:30 AM):June 16June 23June 30July 7 – Special Presentation by Lisa Sanchez\, Lancaster Parks Naturalist \nEach session will take place in beautiful Rader Park\, and snacks will be provided. Please note that a guardian must remain with their child throughout the program. \nRegistration is now open\, Click Here to Register!
URL:https://apostlesucc.org/event/terrific-tuesdays-week-1/
LOCATION:Rader Park\, 1899 Apostles Way\, Lancaster\, PA\, 17603\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://apostlesucc.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Terrific-Tuesdays-2026-Flyer.jpg
END:VEVENT
